  "comments": "<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Obverse:</span><br />\r\nType <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span> - small coat of arms, laurel wreath narrow. Letter T in CENTRAL very close to N and R.<br />\r\nType <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span> - large coat of arms, laurel wreath wide. Letter T in CENTRAL far from N and R.<br />\r\nPicture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/64cf713da4cfb.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/64cf713da4cfb.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"149\" /></a><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Note.</span> Types 1 and 2 describe the two main groups; specific year may have individual features.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Reverse:</span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span> - script thicker. Letter V in NUEVOS is smaller.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span> - script thinner. Letter V in NUEVOS is larger.<br />\r\nPicture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/64cf715669c71.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/64cf715669c71.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"205\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Combinations:</span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span>: 1994, 1995.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span>: 2002-2009.",
